# Intentionally empty.
#
# The compose file mounts this whole provisioning directory read-only over
# /etc/grafana/provisioning, which replaces the empty subdirectories the Grafana
# image ships. Without these placeholders Grafana logs an error on every start
# for each missing subdirectory, which is log noise that looks like a fault.
#
# Alert rules are deliberately out of scope until a contact point exists;
# rules that fire into nothing are worse than no rules.
